SUMMARY:[現場] Festival of Lessons & Carols
LOCATION:Memorial Church
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/lessons_carols
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/54127760847492.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/less
 ons_carols\n\nAll are welcome to this service of Advent and Christmas read
 ings and music\, based on the famous Lessons and Carols Service held annua
 lly at King's College\, Cambridge. Festive music will be sung by the Memor
 ial Church Choir and the Stanford Chamber Chorale.\n\nDoors open at 6:30 p
 m.
END:VEVENT
