BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stanford-53613550873705@didiowen
DTSTAMP:20261006T223216Z
DTSTART:20261122T220000Z
DTEND:20261122T230000Z
SUMMARY:[現場]  Public Tour | Cantor Highlights in Spanish
LOCATION:Cantor Arts Center
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/public-tour-cantor-highlights-spanish
 -language-7060
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/53613550873705.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/publ
 ic-tour-cantor-highlights-spanish-language-7060\n\nExplore the Cantor's co
 llections with a museum engagement guide who will lead you through a selec
 tion of works from different cultures and time periods.\n\n Participants a
 re welcomed to participate in the conversation and provide their thoughts 
 on themes explored throughout the tour but are also free to engage at thei
 r own comfort level. \n\n Tours do not require a reservation and are free 
 of charge. Please check-in at the visitor services desk in the main museum
  lobby. \n\n___________________________________________\n\nExplora las col
 ecciones del Cantor con un guía que te guiará a través de una selecció
 n de obras de diferentes culturas y épocas.\n\nLos participantes están m
 uy bienvenidos a participar en la conversación y aportar sus ideas sobre 
 los temas explorados a lo largo de la visita si lo desean.\n\nLas visitas 
 no requieren reserva previa y son gratuitas. Se ruega registrarse en el mo
 strador de atención al visitante del vestíbulo principal del museo. \n\n
  ¡Esperamos verte en el museo!
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stanford-54127815708604@didiowen
DTSTAMP:20261001T232425Z
DTSTART:20261213T213000Z
DTEND:20261213T223000Z
SUMMARY:[現場] Dr. Robert Huw Morgan: Holiday Organ Concert
LOCATION:Memorial Church
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/dr-rhm-holiday-organ-concert
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/54127815708604.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/dr-r
 hm-holiday-organ-concert\n\nUniversity Organist Dr. Robert Huw Morgan pres
 ents a program of festive organ works celebrating the season. \n\nFree adm
 ission. Donations will be accepted to continue organ concerts at Memorial 
 Church. For questions related to the event\, please contact stanfordorsl@s
 tanford.edu.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stanford-53994312442198@didiowen
DTSTAMP:20261102T121254Z
DTSTART:20261107T010000Z
DTEND:20261107T030000Z
SUMMARY:[現場] First Fridays at IDA (Social)
LOCATION:Harmony House
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/first-fridays-at-ida-social
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/53994312442198.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/firs
 t-fridays-at-ida-social\n\nJoin us at Harmony House for IDA’s monthly Fi
 rst Fridays! A gathering space for artists\, students\, and community to c
 onnect\, unwind\, and create together. Each month\, we open our doors at t
 he Harmony House  for an evening of conversation\, art-making\, and chill 
 vibes over food and drinks. Whether you’re here to meet new people\, sha
 re your work\, or just hang out\, First Fridays are a chance to slow down 
 and be in creative community.
END:VEVENT
