BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stanford-53994406476584@didiowen
DTSTAMP:20260917T025843Z
DTSTART:20270305T180000Z
DTEND:20270306T030000Z
SUMMARY:[現場] The 2027 William & Louise Greaves Filmmaker Seminar
LOCATION:Harmony House\, Various Locations at Stanford University
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/2025-greaves-filmmaker-seminar
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/53994406476584.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/2025
 -greaves-filmmaker-seminar\n報名/票券: https://blackstarprojects.org/s
 eminar/2027-seminar\n\nThe BlackStar Greaves Seminar is a gathering  artis
 ts working in cinematic realms. The Seminar will take place March 5-7\, 20
 27 at Stanford University in Palo Alto\, CA.\n\nOver the course of three d
 ays\, attendees will explore the technical and creative aspects of media-m
 aking\, connect with one another\, and take part in a thoughtful and intim
 ate exchange of ideas. The Seminar is an opportunity for artists\, scholar
 s\, and filmmakers to center their practice while being immersed in the na
 tural beauty of northern California.\n\nThe Seminar is hosted in partnersh
 ip with the Institute for Diversity in the Arts (IDA) at Stanford Universi
 ty.\n\nOur 2027 call for proposals is now open. Curators\, film programmer
 s\, filmmakers\, film workers\, and film scholars are invited to submit a 
 proposal to present a session at the seminar. Learn more and submit by Oct
 ober 5. \n\nGeneral registration will open in November.\n\nFor questions\,
  please contact seminar@blackstarprojects.org.
END:VEVENT
