SUMMARY:[現場] Global Health Research Methods Workshop
LOCATION:Stanford Research Park
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/global-health-research-methods-worksh
 op-2026
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/53418302190186.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/glob
 al-health-research-methods-workshop-2026\n報名/票券: https://docs.goog
 le.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeq6JTQbPFLjaK4MlVNDR1emvOabtonfYKdn0-SFiAe7W8UsA/
 viewform\n\nThis two day all-day\, in-person workshop is for Stanford* Sch
 ool of Medicine fellows\, residents\, medical students\, and faculty inter
 ested in developing research skills applicable to global health. The works
 hop provides a basic overview and roadmap to help people interested in con
 ducting global health research develop their study question into a concept
  note that can form the basis for a study proposal.  The workshop focuses 
 on essential skills to develop a competitive proposal and budget\, includi
 ng how to approach global health research opportunities\, how to engage wi
 th collaborators\, consideration of sample size\, and analytical approach.
END:VEVENT
