LOCATION:Oceano Hotel & Spa
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/pediatric-otolaryngology-updates
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/53619872697622.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/pedi
 atric-otolaryngology-updates\n報名/票券: https://stanford.cloud-cme.co
 m/course/courseoverview?P=5&EID=57459\n\nOverview\nThe goal of this activi
 ty is to provide learners with current\, evidence-based advances and best 
 practices in pediatric otolaryngology. Through expert-led lectures and pan
 el discussions\, faculty will address a broad range of clinical topics\, i
 ncluding hearing screening and management of hearing loss\, foreign bodies
  of the ear\, nose\, and throat\, airway disorders\, sleep-disordered brea
 thing and obstructive sleep apnea\, voice and swallowing disorders\, micro
 tia\, and pediatric head and neck masses. Additional topics will include t
 he evaluation and management of epistaxis\, ankyloglossia (tongue tie)\, a
 nd ear molding. The program is designed to enhance clinicians’ knowledge
 \, diagnostic skills\, and application of contemporary approaches to the c
 are of pediatric patients with otolaryngologic conditions.\n\nRegistration
 Physicians: $495.00\nNurses/APP/Allied Health: $395.00\nIndustry: $595\nNo
