 , ASHA CEU (0.10 hours)\, Non-Physician Participation Credit (10.00 hours)
 \, Speech-Language Pathology Contact Hours (10.00 hours)\n\nTarget Audienc
 eSpecialties - Otolaryngology (ENT)\, PediatricsProfessions - Audiologist\
 , Fellow/Resident\, Non-Physician\, Physician\, Speech Language Pathologis
 t ObjectivesAt the conclusion
