SUMMARY:[現場] Public Tour | A Closer Look
LOCATION:Cantor Arts Center
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/public-tour-a-closer-look
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/53737430746303.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/publ
 ic-tour-a-closer-look\n\nDiscover new details\, perspectives\, and connect
 ions with Cantor’s “A Closer Look” tours. Led by a Stanford Student 
 Guide or volunteer Museum Engagement Guide\, each tour focuses on three to
  four artworks organized around a theme\, providing participants with oppo
 rtunities for contemplation and conversation.\n\nFirst come\, first served
 . Tours do not require a reservation and are free of charge. The tour will
  last between 45 minutes and an hour\, depending on the flow of conversati
 on! Please check in at the visitor services desk* in the main museum lobby
 .\n\n*If you plan to bring a large group with you (10 people or more)\, pl
 ease notify us one week in advance via this form so we can inform our Guid
 es. Thank you!
END:VEVENT
