 Stanford Department of Medicine would like to invite all Stanford communit
 y members to attend this instance of the Medicine Grand Rounds (MGR) serie
 s\, which will feature Sharon Inouye\, MD\, MPH\, a Harvard geriatrician a
 nd Editor-in-Chief of JAMA Internal Medicine who created the Confusion Ass
