DTEND:20270211T230000Z
SUMMARY:[現場] Stanford Global and Planetary Health Research Convening
LOCATION:Frances C. Arrillaga Alumni Center Stanford\, CA
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/stanford-global-and-planetary-health-
 research-convening
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/53853336941939.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/stan
 ford-global-and-planetary-health-research-convening\n報名/票券: https:
 //www.eventbrite.com/e/2027-stanford-global-and-planetary-health-research-
 convening-tickets-1998392877893?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\nAbout the Stanford Gl
 obal and Planetary Health Research Convening\n\nThe 2027 Global and Planet
 ary Health Research Convening will take place Thursday\, Feb. 11 from 9am 
 – 3pm at Stanford.\n\nThe Annual Global and Planetary Health Research Co
 nvening fosters discussion among researchers across a variety of disciplin
 es. We welcome participants to share their ideas and experiences with glob
 al and planetary health research and to explore new collaborations and opp
 ortunities for engagement. Prior convenings have attracted broad participa
 tion from physician-scientists\, engineers\, economists\, earth scientists
 \, ecologists\, and mathematical modelers.\n\nRegister here\n\nAbstract Su
 bmissions\n\nThe Stanford Center for Human and Planetary Health and the Ce
 nter for Innovation in Global Health invite everyone wishing to report on 
 original research or interventions to submit abstracts to be considered fo
 r presentation. This year’s theme is Global and Planetary Health. We wel
 come abstracts from a broad range of topics and disciplines related to the
 se topics. Apply below by Oct. 22 at 5pm PT. \n\nNote: Abstracts should be
  no longer than 1700 characters and must represent academic research.\n\nI
 f you have any questions\, please contact Yosefa Gilon at ygilon@stanford.
 edu.\n\nSubmit an abstract
END:VEVENT
