 public-events/e/54002119865911.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/coll
 ab-lab-nov6\n\nNo scores\, no charts\, no pressure – just collaboration!
 \n\nWhether you are a seasoned musician\, a shower singer\, or someone who
  enjoys clapping on the off-beat – this space is for you! The Collab Lab
  is an open playground to create spontaneous sound. Come to listen\, respo
 nd\, noodle\, experiment\, and  build a creative community across genres a
 nd skill levels.\n\nOpen to Stanford faculty\, staff\, and students of all
  skill levels/instruments/voices.\n\nAdmission Information\n\nFree admissi
 onParking permits are required for weekday campus parking. We recommend do
 wnloading the ParkMobile app before arriving.
