DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/54003371905715.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/wind
 -symphony-fall26\n線上連結: music.stanford.edu/wind_symphony_live\n報
 名/票券: https://live.stanford.edu/s/event?EventID=48601\n\nThe Stanfor
 d Wind Symphony takes audiences on a vibrant musical journey from the anci
 ent streets of Rome in Respighi’s evocative I Pini di Roma to the breath
 taking landscapes of Yagisawa’s Machu Picchu\, alongside the luminous en
 ergy of Mackey’s Aurora Awakes and the youthful exuberance of Reed’s T
 he Hounds of Spring. The program includes Borne’s virtuosic Carmen Fanta
 sy\, featuring Stanford student flutist Erica Wang as soloist\, bringing t
 he brilliance and expressive power of the flute to the concert stage.\n\nA
 dmission Information\n\nGeneral – $37 | Seniors (65+) and Non-Stanford S
 tudents – $32\nPrice shown reflects total cost including $4 online/phone
  per-ticket fee.FREE admission for Stanford University students. One ticke
 t per ID\, available beginning one hour prior to curtain at the venue.This
  event will be livestreamed.
END:VEVENT
