SUMMARY:[混合] Stanford Afro-Latin Jazz Ensemble
LOCATION:Dinkelspiel Auditorium
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/salje-fall26
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/54003401521776.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/salj
 e-fall26\n線上連結: https://music.stanford.edu/salje_live\n報名/票
 券: https://live.stanford.edu/s/event?EventID=48801\n\nThe acclaimed Stan
 ford Afro-Latin Jazz Ensemble\, directed by Murray Low\, presents their fi
 rst performance of the academic year! We are exciting to playing for you a
 gain.   As usual\, the group have a complete new set of music prepared cov
 ering all aspects of the idiom - classic and modern salsa\, boleros\, samb
 a\, rumba\, Latin jazz\, and much more! Works include those written or per
 formed by icons such as Rubén Blades\, Los Van Van\, Celia Cruz\, Elis Re
 gina\, Gilberto Gil\, and even Michael Jackson! There is something for eve
 ryone. The music is guaranteed to perk up your ears - and dancing in the a
 isles is encouraged.\n\nAdmission Information\n\nGeneral – $32 | Seniors
  (65+) and Non-Stanford Students – $27\nPrice shown reflects total cost 
 including $4 online/phone per-ticket fee.FREE admission for Stanford Unive
 rsity students. One ticket per ID\, available beginning one hour prior to 
 curtain at the venue.This event will be livestreamed.
END:VEVENT
