SUMMARY:[混合] Another Look presents Tobias Wolff's "Old School"
LOCATION:Stanford Humanities Center\, Levinthal Hall
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/another-look-presents-tobias-wolffs-o
 ld-school
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/54031148397687.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/anot
 her-look-presents-tobias-wolffs-old-school\n報名/票券: https://stanfor
 d.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_wSuJ-_3QTWGKLDxM6yKFtA\n\nPlease join us at 
 7 p.m. (PST) on Tuesday\, November 17\, as we launch our fifteenth season 
 of the Another Look book club.\n\nOur discussion will feature Stanford Pro
 f. Tobias Wolff’s novel Old School\, published in 2003. The renowned aut
 hor is a master of the short story and the memoir\, and a celebrated teach
 er of creative writing. This is his first full-length novel. Our event wil
 l also be a celebration of Toby\, the National Medal of Arts winning autho
 r who has contributed so much to Stanford and its English/Creative Writing
  programs over the years. For many of us\, he has been a wise teacher and 
 friend as well. \n\nThe hybrid event will take place in Stanford’s Levin
 thal Hall\, at the Stanford Humanities Center at 424 Santa Teresa Street o
 n the Stanford campus. Panelists to be announced soon.\n\nAs always\, the 
 event is free and open to the public. Walk-ins are welcome but registratio
 n is encouraged.Go here to register.\n\nhttps://stanford.zoom.us/webinar/r
 egister/WN_wSuJ-_3QTWGKLDxM6yKFtA#/registration
