DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/54095570012306.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/cmem
 s-katerina-levinson-presents-maternal-warriors\n\nOrganized and hosted by 
 the Center for Medieval and Early Modern Studies (CMEMS).\n\nKaterina Levi
 nson (ILAC\, Stanford) presents\, "Maternal Warriors: Transatlantic Iconog
 raphy in the Spanish and Nahuatl 'The Mother of the Best'"\n\nWith a respo
 nse from Regina Pieck (Comparative Literature\, Stanford).\n\n \n\nThe CME
 MS Workshop series meets most Wednesdays during the academic year. Lunch i
 s provided. See the CMEMS website for the list of upcoming speakers.
END:VEVENT
