LOCATION:
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/2027-annual-conference-in-menopause-h
 ealthy-aging
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/54124876661625.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/2027
 -annual-conference-in-menopause-healthy-aging\n報名/票券: https://stan
 ford.cloud-cme.com/course/courseoverview?P=5&EID=59455\n\nOverviewThis con
 ference will equip you with the knowledge and tools to support your patien
 ts through the menopause transition and beyond. You'll learn from experts 
 how to manage symptoms of perimenopause and menopause — hot flashes\, sl
 eep and mood disturbances\, cognitive changes\, sexual dysfunction\, skin 
 and hair issues - plus how to address long term priorities like bone healt
 h\, heart health\, breast cancer risk and the role of supplements.\n\nRegi
 strationThe webinar will be presented live on Pacific Standard Time. All s
 essions will be recorded and the recordings will be provided to all regist
 rants to review until August 31\, 2027\, including those who were not able
  to attend any of the live sessions.\n\nRegistration fee includes course m
 aterials\, certificate of participation\, and the webinar recordings. \n\n
 You will receive the Zoom information the week before the webinar. If you 
 register within a week of the webinar\, you will receive the Zoom informat
 ion on Tuesday\, March 9th. \n\nEarly Bird Rates:\nPhysician - $495\nRN/AH
 P/Other:  $350\nNurse Practitioner (NP): $350\nNurse Rn/APRN: $350\nPA: $3
 50\nPsychologist: $350\nSocial Worker: $350\n\nRegistration Rate After 12/
 10/2026:\nPhysician - $695\nRN/AHP/Other:  $450\nNurse Practitioner (NP): 
 $450\nNurse Rn/APRN: $450\nPA: $450\nPsychologist: $450\nSocial Worker: $4
 50\n\nRegistration fees may be paid by credit card - Visa\, MasterCard\, o
 r American Express. Your email address is used for critical information\, 
 including registration confirmation\, evaluation
END:VEVENT
