 public-events/e/54251566724146.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/suns
 hine-bryant-lin-in-conversation-with-latha-palaniappan\n報名/票券: htt
 ps://stanforduniversity.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_aaa9Vq5s5cyZJ8a\n\nLeadi
