 t he’s learned as a physician and as a patient\, after being diagnosed w
 ith his own terminal illness. He will be joinined by Latha Palaniappan\, M
 D\, MS\, co-director\, Center for Asian Health and Education at Stanford U
 niversity. \n\nLight lunch provided.
