 is/event/craft-the-collection_vegetable-printing\n\nOpen to Stanford stude
 nts\, staff\, faculty\, and affiliates.\n\nJoin us at Craft the Collection
 : Vegetable Printing & Relief Embroidery Workshop! 🥔🪡🎨🌱\n\nIns
 pired by In Focus: Asian American Art from the Collection\, our inaugural 
