 d-smart-swaps
DESCRIPTION:➕ 加到我的行事曆: https://didiowen.github.io/stanford-
 public-events/e/54322589080002.ics\nhttps://events.stanford.edu/event/lowe
 r-carb-makeovers-carb-counting-and-smart-swaps\n線上連結: https://heal
 thlibrary.stanford.edu/lectures-events.html#carb-counting\n報名/票券: 
 https://healthlibrary.stanford.edu/lectures-events.html#carb-counting\n\nJ
 essica Shipley\, MS\, RD\, CDCES\, presents a practical session on reducin
 g dietary carbohydrates to support glycemic control. Learn carb counting\,
  portion control\, label reading\, lower-carb substitutions for common sta
 ples\, sample meal ideas\, and strategies to tailor choices to individual 
